{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1180911,\"title\":\"Silk and Seduction\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"As private investigator Johnny Wadd continues his pursuit of the legendary Sword of Charlemagne, he encounters the mysterious and enigmatic Rita Cortez. She captures his heart and tries to steal his soul while leading him into a dangerous underworld of bizarre and twisted desires.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wd91lNv9gq8gdxDklIkibv2rkK7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2002,\"runtime\":106,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bob Chinn\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":45005,\"name\":\"Bob Chinn\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qUJ7vh3ectj8T2ZcWoobimKUZ3s.jpg\"},{\"id\":460504,\"name\":\"Joel Lawrence\",\"character\":\"Johnny Wadd\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rmeoE4i8lXihBhhV6mJGZjrMsVi.jpg\"},{\"id\":143297,\"name\":\"Sunrise Adams\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3XaZkWjb9DEv89C9IUJWgHsXHHj.jpg\"},{\"id\":45005,\"name\":\"Bob Chinn\",\"character\":\"Frankie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qUJ7vh3ectj8T2ZcWoobimKUZ3s.jpg\"},{\"id\":574827,\"name\":\"Alexa Rae\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rcSVQDcvkYl1z5xqEOmQb2gqTkS.jpg\"},{\"id\":1264122,\"name\":\"Autumn Haze\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5KNjN0qUsgE1hsci3uj50q1AZzG.jpg\"},{\"id\":999477,\"name\":\"Bamboo\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8d7aTY5EHq1vAyCz6dGbLxYEQWg.jpg\"},{\"id\":151927,\"name\":\"Gina Ryder\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5yXECnYktFvgtpvWTXFlTCqp89E.jpg\"},{\"id\":1632285,\"name\":\"Ginger Paige\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1BTnDhDijiQeDfM7l928JD1gvUj.jpg\"},{\"id\":932320,\"name\":\"Inari Vachs\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2PqcI79g9Lwt6nLIv19COvaIoyb.jpg\"},{\"id\":54725,\"name\":\"Jenna Haze\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wXYw3NSsmMtKdK8jmI9UvZmfiX5.jpg\"},{\"id\":574352,\"name\":\"Lee Stone\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bY4Cdg2ppTRLoP7WDORd6XyoEYt.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":75612,\"title\":\"Oblivion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eO3r38fwnhb58M1YgcjQBd3VNcp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2kVt8oj1cSz4GAP0Hi8SESOiH0T.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jack Harper is one of the last few drone repairmen stationed on Earth. Part of a massive operation to extract vital resources after decades of war with a terrifying threat known as the Scavs, Jack’s mission is nearly complete. His existence is brought crashing down when he rescues a beautiful  stranger from a downed spacecraft. Her arrival triggers a chain of events that  forces him to question everything he knows and puts the fate of humanity in his hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2059,\"title\":\"National Treasure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jKbZBMRFpF2EfFuvrsDZ2uQYsEQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9EnZD3ZWjpJy4IPoQkqTzxvZrso.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Modern treasure hunters, led by archaeologist Ben Gates, search for a chest of riches rumored to have been stashed away by George Washington, Thomas Jefferson and Benjamin Franklin during the Revolutionary War. The chest's whereabouts may lie in secret clues embedded in the Constitution and the Declaration of Independence, and Gates is in a race to find the gold before his enemies do.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":335787,\"title\":\"Uncharted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rJHC1RUORuUhtfNb4Npclx0xnOf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fwrqW8Lp5VQuppFrODd4iJ8LySE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young street-smart, Nathan Drake and his wisecracking partner Victor “Sully” Sullivan embark on a dangerous pursuit of “the greatest treasure never found” while also tracking clues that may lead to Nathan’s long-lost brother.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":58574,\"title\":\"Sherlock Holmes: A Game of Shadows\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y1MYZkwhZK6L0Jy4YMuPktzDOfn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lWNASscWXn32Asr9vkB1wq6cKvD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"There is a new criminal mastermind at large (Professor Moriarty) and not only is he Holmes’ intellectual equal, but his capacity for evil and lack of conscience may give him an advantage over the detective.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":513692,\"title\":\"Raging Fire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nD9zK3nfEUPHKWwFmAaQoLsQYE5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kHXblysahey0anR3M2dYoYw51FD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cheung Sung-bong is a highly respected cop with a long history of success in dangerous cases. However, his past soon comes back to haunt him when a former protégé resurfaces, seeking revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":638974,\"title\":\"Murder Mystery 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s1VzVhXlqsevi8zeCMG9A16nEUf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AwB7HGeDTrBGkP2WEnNwg8Wa0E4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After starting their own detective agency, Nick and Audrey Spitz land a career-making case when their billionaire pal is kidnapped from his wedding.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7364,\"title\":\"Sahara\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyY1onYxkKBDlJsheRsVbMaoQEM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CXQ9wYj4n9MBwy2TQ92YaRygWj.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned adventurer and treasure hunter Dirk Pitt, a former Navy SEAL, sets out for the African desert with his wisecracking buddy Al in search of a confederate ironclad battleship rumored to have vanished long ago, the main draw being the treasure supposedly hidden within the lost vessel. When the daring duo come across Dr. Eva Rojas, a beautiful scientist who is juggling an escape from a warlord and a mission to stop the spread of a powerful plague, their desert expedition begins to heat up.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":34813,\"title\":\"The Losers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e5oD3fuQpjZ8Po6WNW0VkUJmW52.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hACMcim5NtMH3S62sQAWkdLVpIK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a mission deep in the Bolivian jungle, a team of elite commandos finds itself on the receiving end of a lethal betrayal. Now presumed dead, the men join forces with a mysterious operative named Aisha to hunt down their enemy and even the score.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":35552,\"title\":\"The Extraordinary Adventures of Adèle Blanc-Sec\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1nYv7H0XJFgrJ5LewGlyNDvjqdq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oktRqHfL2ORYAwpIZh7ZfXw72TE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An adventure set in the early part of the 20th century, focused on a popular novelist and her dealings with would-be suitors, the cops, monsters, and other distractions.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":48492,\"title\":\"Detective Dee and the Mystery of the Phantom Flame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qWOBV05kNeLyaiA31DFkZlMpta5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/af3gx7Tuu08pf8ioJU0ok6r407J.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the future empress Wu Zetian's two courtiers die in a mysterious fire, she gets Di Renjie, a former detective and rebel, released from prison to solve the mystery of the fire.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":389053,\"title\":\"The Do-Over\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z9VCm2E6gCAwbM2SELRawfqdXBO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rDZArKpxVhrLXrRYD9xF271klVf.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of a bank manager is turned upside down when a friend from his past manipulates him into faking his own death and taking off on an adventure.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"NiBshBoh3h8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"yZ8ckZRoXwo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ztVg7qSMfr0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}